          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 82518,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Conoscere la somma dei numeri nelle liste è utile quando confronti diversi set di dati, come la differenza tra le iscrizioni settimanali nell'arco di due mesi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"signups_june = [\" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"signups_july = [\" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Method call",
            "id": 82519,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per calcolare il totale di una lista, usiamo <code>sum()</code>, con il nome della lista tra parentesi, come <code>sum(signups)</code> qui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"signups = [\" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(signups))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"68\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>sum</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>signups</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Negative numbers",
            "id": 82520,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando un elenco contiene anche numeri negativi come <code>-3</code>, i numeri negativi vengono sottratti dalla somma dei numeri positivi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"quarterly_growth = [\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(quarterly_growth))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"22\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>-3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Save in variable",
            "id": 82521,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per riutilizzare la somma della lista <code>scores</code>, possiamo memorizzare il risultato in una variabile come <code>total</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"total = sum(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(total)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"42\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"22\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>total</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>sum(scores)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Memorizza il totale della lista <code>scores</code> in <code>total</code>, in modo che il codice stampi <code>22</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"total = sum(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(total)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"min(scores)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"22\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>total</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>sum(scores)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Method call",
            "id": 82690,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa fa <code>sum()</code> quando viene usato su un elenco di numeri?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Somma i numeri nell'elenco</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ci indica il numero di elementi nella lista</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Somma i numeri nell'elenco.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La funzione <code>sum()</code> somma i numeri di una lista.</p><p>La lista è <code>points = [4, 6, 3]</code>. Che cosa restituisce <code>sum(points)</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>13</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code>, perché la lista contiene tre valori</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>6</code>, perché è il valore maggiore</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>13</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Negative numbers",
            "id": 82691,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa succede quando usiamo <code>sum()</code> su una lista che contiene numeri negativi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Otterremo la somma dei numeri positivi, meno quella dei numeri negativi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">I numeri negativi non verranno presi in considerazione</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Otterremo la somma dei numeri positivi, meno quella dei numeri negativi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando <code>sum()</code> usa una lista con numeri negativi, questi valori riducono il totale.</p><p>Che cosa restituisce <code>sum([7, -2, 1])</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>6</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>8</code>, perché il valore negativo viene ignorato</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code>, perché il valore negativo viene sottratto due volte</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>6</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Save in variable",
            "id": 82692,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come possiamo riutilizzare il risultato di <code>sum()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Salviamo il risultato in una variabile</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non possiamo riutilizzare il risultato dell'uso di <code>sum()</code> su una lista</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Salviamo il risultato in una variabile.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo riutilizzare il risultato di <code>sum()</code> salvandolo in una variabile.</p><p>Quale riga memorizza il totale di <code>expenses</code> in <code>total</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>total = sum(expenses)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>total == sum(expenses)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>total = expenses</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>total = sum(expenses)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Method call",
            "id": 82693,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Somma i prezzi in un carrello della spesa online con <code>sum()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cart = [\" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(cart))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"86\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>sum</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>cart</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La lista <code>cart</code> contiene i prezzi di tre articoli. Stampa il prezzo totale, <code>86</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cart = [\" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(cart))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"min\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"max\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"50\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"86\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>sum</code>, seguito da <code>(</code>, <code>cart</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Negative numbers",
            "id": 82694,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifica <code>-3</code> punti di penalità in modo che <code>sum(points_penalties)</code> restituisca <code>7</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"points_penalties = [\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(points_penalties))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"7\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>-3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il secondo numero, <code>10</code>, è un bonus. Imposta il primo numero in modo che penalità e bonus diano un totale di <code>7</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"points_penalties = [\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sum(points_penalties))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-7\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"7\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>-3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Save in variable",
            "id": 82695,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Salva la quantità totale di zucchero necessaria per una ricetta di torta nella variabile <code>total</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"sugar = [\" /><text value=\"120\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"total = sum(sugar)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(total)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"36\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"170\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>total</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>sum(sugar)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Somma entrambe le quantità di zucchero e memorizza il risultato in <code>total</code>, in modo che il codice stampi <code>170</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"sugar = [\" /><text value=\"120\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"total = sum(sugar)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(total)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"max(sugar)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"170\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>total</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>sum(sugar)</code>.</p></body></html>",
